<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal sets 50 bln esc variable rate repo.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal sets 50 bln esc variable rate repo.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal offered to inject 50 billion escudos of seven-day funds into the money market in a variable rate securities repurchase tender effective at the start of a new commercial bank reserve period on Thursday.</p>
<p>The central bank previously injected funds at 7.25 percent.</p>
<p>Bids must be submitted by 1415 GMT.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
